:40,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"40:30","t":"And he who believed said, \"O my people, indeed I fear for you [a fate] like the day of the companies -","j":24,"h":47,"s":40,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"40:31","t":"Like the custom of the people of Noah and of ʿAad and Thamūd and those after them. And Allāh wants no injustice for [His] servants.","j":24,"h":47,"s":40,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"40:32","t":"And O my people, indeed I fear for you the Day of Calling -","j":24,"h":47,"s":40,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"40:33","t":"The Day you will turn your backs fleeing; there is not for you from Allāh any protector. And whoever Allāh sends astray - there is not for him any guide.","j":24,"h":47,"s":40,"a":33,"sd":null}],"juz":24,"hizb":47,"surahs":[40],"sajdah":false}